												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div style="display:none"> <p>此处为基金会宇宙从神话时代到当代的诸多大事件一览，内容整合自多个设定中心与系列故事。</p> </div> <div> <div style="float:left;margin-top: -1rem;"> <p><a name="top"></a> [ <a href="#bottom">▽ 直达底部</a> ]</p> </div> <div style="float:right;"></div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="phone"> <div class="shelf-1 shelf-wrap trans-yes my-plank-{$my-plank}"> <div class="shelf-yes"></div> <div class="et-plank-wrap"> <div class="et-plank"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <p><a name="cover"></a></p> <div id="wiki-tabview-8cfd006efa03a48c0a7e6ef4ed4f1bb1" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>封面</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>系列典籍</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>太初以降</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>元始祖劫</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>开辟海托世</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>第二海托世</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>诸神黄昏</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>上古秘史</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>无人采薇</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>先秦遗事</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>走马千年</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>昨日风云</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>还看今朝</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>封底</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="box-txt-cover" style="text-align:center;font-size:200%;color:#3f5b15"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/etinjat-2/Liber.jpg" width="200px" alt="Liber.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p><strong>十方大梦溶朝露</strong><br /> <strong>亿世劫灰沦太渊</strong></p> <p><br /></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="box-txt"> <div class="front-title tt-out"> <div class="front-title tt-inner"> <h1><span>╣ 设定集 ╠</span></h1> </div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://etinjat.wikidot.com/kalpas-theory">万劫历数中出现的诸神</a></strong><br /> <em>罗天众神，漫录通鉴</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="front-title tt-out"> <div class="front-title tt-inner"> <h1><span>╣ 黄尘清水 ╠</span></h1> </div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-poem-in-dust-that-xuanpin">诗钞——玄牝</a></strong><br /> <em>遂古之初，谁传道之？</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-serpent-who-hold-a-flower-in-mouth">外典：衔花之蛇</a></strong><br /> <em>被放逐者，硫磺血华</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-kismet-ephemeris-of-kalpas-vol-7-part-2">万劫历数混元通纪 · 十纪卮言第七 · 中</a></strong><br /> <em>古蛇叛乱，诸神黄昏</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-court-of-the-hanged-king">愚者史诗 —— 缢王深殿里</a></strong><br /> <em>战乱所起，王缢而死</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-old-gospel-of-fuxi-that-wuyou">三坟崖书 · 人才卷 · 无囿</a></strong><br /> <em>伏羲讲道，黄帝躬闻</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-lost-book-of-documents-in-shang-that-golden-declaration">逸商书 · 金誓 · 注疏</a></strong><br /> <em>欲肉作乱，妇好伐罪</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/to-be-a-couple">关于欲肉教血脉和合论神话起源文献记录</a></strong><br /> <em>血脉和合，姻缘丝连</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="front-title tt-out"> <div class="front-title tt-inner"> <h1><s