ies"> <h1><span>队伍名称：Antagonish</span></h1> <p><strong>队伍成员：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-calloway" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4474143&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="Researcher Calloway" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4474143)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-calloway" >Researcher Calloway</a></span>（队长？），<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ipdarby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4679835&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="IPDarby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4679835)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ipdarby" >IPDarby</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peatmoss" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6109025&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="Peatmoss" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6109025)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peatmoss" >Peatmoss</a></span><br /> <strong>所选设定：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-man-who-wasnt-there-hub">乌有之人</a></p> <hr /> <h3><span>参赛条目：</span></h3> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><em>这个竞赛由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3072585&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="Modulum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3072585)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum" >Modulum</a></span>和<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" >ProcyonLotor</a></span>组织。规则主要由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3072585&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="Modulum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3072585)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum" >Modulum</a></span>所写，并被<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" >ProcyonLotor</a></span>略微修改。计时器由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=318209&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="DrMagnus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=318209)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" >DrMagnus</a></span>所制，队伍中心格式为<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>所修改。</em></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4113182&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="Esperanza_Cai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4113182)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" >Esperanza_Cai</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-674419-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 可以基于个别情况采纳在竞赛开始之前未完成的草稿。通常规则是草稿尚未完成一半； 如果你不确定， 请随时询问。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-674419-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. <strong>译注：</strong>即美国东部标准时间，比北京时间慢13个小时。</div> </div> 
