g></span></h2> <p><strong>红-2</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Red-2"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Red-2/medium.jpg" alt="Red-2" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3001">▶原文由此</a> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-2845 牡鹿</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>THE DEER 3</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/THE-DEER-3"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/THE-DEER-3/medium.jpg" alt="THE-DEER-3" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2845">▶原文由此</a></p> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-882 一台机器</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>A Machine 1</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">挖出来的旧作<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/A-Machine"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/A-Machine/medium.jpg" alt="A-Machine" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-882">▶原文由此</a> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-049 疫医</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>Plague Doctor 2</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">我觉得反色版本更舒服，但它是黑色的<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Plague-Doctor-2:W"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Plague-Doctor-2:W/medium.jpg" alt="Plague-Doctor-2:W" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Plague Doctor 1</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Plague-Doctor-1:W"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Plague-Doctor-1:W/medium.jpg" alt="Plague-Doctor-1:W" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-049">▶原文由此</a></p> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-053 小姑娘</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>Young Girl 2</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">更大龄的版本<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Young-Girl-2"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Young-Girl-2/medium.jpg" alt="Young-Girl-2" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Young Girl 1</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">年龄上稍大了<br /> 少了狂气，多了崩坏<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Young-Girl"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Young-Girl/medium.jpg" alt="Young-Girl" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-053">▶原文由此</a> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-166(旧)</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼Teenage&nbsp;Succubus</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲魅魔少女</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">虽然已经重写了，但还是会画画旧166(<br /> <strong>Teenage Succubus-2</strong><br /> 准备重画(x<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Teenage%20Succubus-2%3AB"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Teenage%20Succubus-2%3AB/medium.jpg" alt="Teenage%20Succubus-2%3AB" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-1003 绦虫婴儿</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼Tapeworm&nbsp;Child</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲绦虫婴儿</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Tapeworm%20Child"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Tapeworm%20Child/medium.jpg" alt="Tapeworm%20Child" class="image" /></a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp--1003">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>其他</span></h1> <p>一些乱七八糟的、基于SCP世界观的创作(无理二设注意)</p> <h2><span>杂图</span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼叛教</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲救赎</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">旧图<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/PJ_JS"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/PJ_JS/medium.jpg" alt="PJ_JS" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼God</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲皮下</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/God-PX%3AB"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/God-PX%3AB/medium.jpg" alt="God-PX%3AB" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h2><span>乱画</span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼SCP-053</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲Parenthood</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Parenthood"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Parenthood/medium.jpg" alt="Parenthood" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼SCP-5000</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲行</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/%E8%A1%8C"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/%E8%A1%8C/medium.jpg" alt="行" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>故事相关</span></h1> <p>随意</p> <h2><span><strong>欢爱之血肉</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼The&nbsp;Flesh&nbsp;That&nbsp;Mates</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">The&nbsp;Flesh&nbsp;That&nbsp;Mates</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/The-Flesh-That-Mates"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/The-Flesh-That-Mates/medium.jpg" alt="The-Flesh-That-Mates" class="image" /></a><br /> 低技术力，应该不会引起不适<br /> <span style="font-size:xx-small;">原本想画男人，但不会</span><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-flesh-that-mates">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>人物相关</span></h1> <p>一言难尽</p> <h2><span><strong>Dr.Clef</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/drclef-member-page">▶人事页</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Alto-Clef:B"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Alto-Clef:B/medium.jpg" alt="Alto-Clef:B" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: transparent">“只希望它们能够比我存在得更久远。”</span><br /> <span style="color: transparent">“祂依旧注视着。”</span></p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xashf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893376&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609384430" alt="XashF" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893376)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xashf" >XashF</a></span></p> 
